      <h1 class="ed-title">Treadmill Heart Rate Zones</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        Zones are a useful framework built on an estimate that is wrong for most individuals. Here is how to use them anyway, and when to ignore the number and listen to your breathing instead.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
